	(text "A/B LINK NETWORK (D-054).
Path A, default: BYP1+BYP2 fitted, AD620 socket empty - ADS1220 PGA reads the bridge directly.
Path B: pull BYP1+BYP2, fit BYP3+BYP4 and the AD620 - two-stage chain, as Wirikuta had it.
Never fit all four: that shorts the amplifier output to the bridge."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 206.0000 150.0000 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.40 1.40)
				(thickness 0.21)
				(bold no)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "06c0d399-7926-4cd5-8264-66351a529d56")
	)
